  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "UI-1",
      "priority": "P2",
      "title": "Render the minimap outside the horizontal ScrollArea content UI",
      "path": "src/repo/graph_view/mod.rs",
      "line_start": 440,
      "line_end": 441,
      "trigger": "Open non-ghost history with map_area.width() > 480 and map_area.height() > 120, so show_map is true.",
      "impact": "The minimap is painted and registered for pointer interaction using a UI whose horizontal clip ends before the reserved minimap strip, so the map disappears and cannot be clicked or dragged.",
      "evidence": [
        "graph_rows_view computes map_rect from map_area.right()-78 through map_area.right(), then narrows the graph UI to map_area.width()-84 (lines 175-185).",
        "The new horizontal ScrollArea begins at lines 238-241 and the history_minimap call remains inside its show closure at lines 440-441.",
        "history_minimap uses ui.interact(rect, ...) and ui.painter_at(rect) in src/repo/graph_view/minimap.rs:132-146.",
        "The locally installed egui ScrollArea clips the content UI on enabled axes to inner_rect (scroll_area.rs:811-825); Ui::painter_at intersects the requested rect with the UI clip (ui.rs:616-621). The reserved map starts six points to the right of the clipped graph viewport."
      ],
      "recommendation": "Capture or return the vertical offset and viewport height from horizontal.show, then call history_minimap with the parent UI after the horizontal scroll area has finished. Keep its hit target and paint outside the horizontal content clip.",
      "validation_requested": "Parent should add or run an inert production graph_view case asserting minimap paint/hit geometry and click/drag offset updates with horizontal scrolling both absent and active; this review did not execute it."
    },
    {
      "id": "UI-2",
      "priority": "P2",
      "title": "Localize the compact settings page selector captions",
      "path": "src/settings/page.rs",
      "line_start": 89,
      "line_end": 93,
      "trigger": "Set the application locale to German and open Settings at an available width below 760 logical points.",
      "impact": "The selected page and every dropdown option display the raw English Page::title() values (including Context menus), while the existing wide navigation and page headings display translated captions.",
      "evidence": [
        "The new compact ComboBox selected_text uses view.page.title() directly at line 89 and selectable_value uses page.title() directly at line 93.",
        "Page::title returns raw English stable identities in src/settings/mod.rs:1484-1498.",
        "The wide nav and title use super::labels::display; src/settings/labels.rs maps these identities, including the new Context menus key."
      ],
      "recommendation": "Pass Page::title() through super::labels::display for selected_text and each visible option, while preserving the raw page enum, salt, search and row identities.",
      "validation_requested": "Parent should exercise the compact selector under de and en-US and ensure its display labels match the wide nav; this review did not execute it."
    }
  ],
